-- a module recorded (the body its text) or dropped, and logged when its pointer moved (the session's
-- `write` checked it; whoever uses it checks it again)
s-changed : List Word → List Word → List Word → List Word → Proc W (List Word)
s-changed st hx p now = if h-eq now p then ret {lzero} {W} (s-response "text/plain" now) else s-logged st hx now
